WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.480
Activation is not a one-time event, it's a daily practice, it's the conscious choice

00:07.480 --> 00:13.340
to filter your decisions through your M.V.P., it's the courage to embrace resistance as

00:13.340 --> 00:21.040
training ground for your resilience and the wisdom to proactively plan to build your agility.

00:21.040 --> 00:27.340
Your playbook for this lesson is filled with drills to help you put this concept into practice.

00:27.340 --> 00:32.900
Take the time to work through the scenarios and stress test your own goals.

00:32.900 --> 00:36.980
This is how you move from knowing to doing.

00:36.980 --> 00:43.060
In our next lesson, we will focus on how to sustain the momentum, focusing on the critical

00:43.060 --> 00:45.780
or A.R.A.W. pillar of wellbeing.

00:45.780 --> 00:48.940
You have your blueprint and your game plan.

00:48.940 --> 00:50.660
You are in the game.

00:50.660 --> 00:51.660
You're ready.

00:51.660 --> 00:52.660
You've got this.

00:52.660 --> 00:55.380
Now, make it happen.

00:55.380 --> 00:58.660
Head to your playbook and you'll see the next briefing.

